      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.6.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.6.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The nethermost chamber ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " five cubits broad, and the middle ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " six cubits broad, and the third ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " seven cubits broad: for without ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in the wall",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the house he made narrowed rests round about, that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the beams",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " should not be fastened in the walls of the house.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1KI.6.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1KI.6.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the house, when it was in building, was built of stone made ready before it was brought thither; so that there was neither hammer nor ax ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "nor",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " any tool of iron heard in the house, while it was in building.",
